    "official_description": "After arriving in Wuhan without a Top 100 win to her name, qualifier Shi Han earned her third in a matter of days Monday night, rallying from a set down to upset Alexandra Eala 4-6, 6-3, 6-3 in 2 hours, 27 minutes.",
    "official_description_source": "https://www.wtatennis.com/videos/4591125/world-no-217-shi-pulls-off-wuhan-stunner-against-eala",
    "safe_narration": "施晗从资格赛突围，三天连胜斯特恩斯、拉希莫娃和伊埃拉。来武汉前，她还没赢过世界前一百选手，如今连续三场做到了。",
    "note": "Top100 prior-history claim attributed to official WTA description; qualifying wins independently verified official matches; no exhaustive career database audit claim.",
